easyraft is an independent C++ implementation of the Raft consensus protocol.
Its architecture and protocol behavior are inspired by OpenRaft
(https://github.com/databendlabs/openraft), specifically the 0.10 line
(the `release-0.10` branch and the published 0.10.0 crate). easyraft is not
an official OpenRaft port, is not a Databend project, and does not contain
OpenRaft source code.

OpenRaft is developed by the Databend authors and is itself derived from the
original async-raft project (notably Anthony Dodd and the async-raft authors).
OpenRaft is licensed under MIT OR Apache-2.0.
